{
  "Combat.Kitsune.CameWorms": "[pg]The kitsune recoils before running off, no longer interested in you..."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Entwine.One": "The kitsune closes in on you with a mischievous glint in her eyes. Suddenly, you feel something coiling around your leg, and you are lifted into the air, entangled in her tails!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Entwine.Two": "Your limbs are bound tightly while coils of delightfully soft fur caress you on all sides."
  "Combat.Kitsune.FoxFire.One": "The kitsune makes a small circle in the air with her fingers, conjuring a pale blue flame into her palm. Pursing her lips, she blows it toward you with a kiss."
  "Combat.Kitsune.FoxFire.Two": "The flames burn furiously, but leave you with an incredibly pleasant tingling sensation all over your body."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Illusion.One": "You struggle to keep your eyes on the kitsune, ghostly laughter echoing all around you as the edges of reality blur around her."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Illusion.Resisted": "You tighten your focus, and she suddenly reels in pain, clutching her forehead as she is thrust back into view. You have resisted her illusions."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Attack.One": "[themonster] playfully darts around you, grinning coyly. Before you can react, she draws a small circle on your chest with her fingertip, and your movements halt mid-swing."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Attack.Three": "Despite your best efforts, every time you attempt to attack her, your muscles recoil involuntarily. The kitsune's spell has sealed your attack!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Attack.Two": "\"Naughty naughty, you should be careful with that.\""
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Items": "\"Tsk tsk, using items? That's cheating!\" A glowing rune appears on your pack, and no matter how hard you try, you can't seem to pry it open. The kitsune's spell has sealed your items!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Magical.One": "You jump with surprise as the kitsune appears in front of you, grinning coyly. She draws a small circle on your forehead."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Magical.Three": "The kitsune's spell has sealed your magical skills!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Magical.Two": "\"Oh no darling, I'm the one with all the tricks here.\""
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Movement": "\"Tsk tsk, leaving so soon?\" A glowing rune appears on your chest, and your legs won't budge. The kitsune's spell prevents your escape!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Physical.One": "You jump with surprise as the kitsune appears in front of you, grinning coyly. She draws a small circle on your forehead."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Physical.Three": "The kitsune's spell has sealed your physical skills!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Physical.Two": "\"Oh no darling, I'm the one with all the tricks here.\""
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Resisted": "Upon your touch, the seal dissipates and you are free of the kitsune's magic!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Spells": "\"Oh silly, trying to beat me at my own game are you?\" The kitsune traces a small circle around your mouth, and you find yourself stricken mute and unable to cast. The kitsune's spell has sealed your magic!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Seal.Tease": "You are taken by surprise when the kitsune appears in front of you out of nowhere, trailing a fingertip down your chest. All your knowledge of seduction escapes you. The kitsune's spell has sealed your ability to tease!"
  "Combat.Kitsune.Tease.One": "You rub your eyes, suddenly seeing triple as you find yourself in the midst of a crowd of kitsune doppelgangers, running their hands all over you."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Tease.Three": "Turning her back to you, the kitsune fans out her tails and lifts the hem of her robe to expose her plump hindquarters."
  "Combat.Kitsune.Tease.Two": "Bending forward, the kitsune runs her hands down over her breasts, jiggling them enticingly."
}
